@startuml
title To-Be Target Context - library-service Centric

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Librarian
actor Admin
rectangle Browser
node "library-service" as Library
database PostgreSQL
node "service-monitor" as Monitor

Librarian --> Browser : manage books / members / loans
Admin --> Browser : view monitoring and operations
Browser --> Library : business pages and forms
Library --> PostgreSQL : persistent storage
Monitor --> Library : health / runtime observation

note right of Library
Target scope from docx:
- Feature-first + 3-layer + MVC
- Book / Member / Loan full lifecycle
- server-rendered views
end note

@enduml
